{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Mercury Retrograde"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Bad Things and Good People"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le17ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Uses of Perfect Continuous Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Perfect Continuous tenses focus on a past period leading up to a present one. They show that an event continues or temporary (like other continuous tenses)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Past or Present Perfect Continuous to talk about something that is incomplete, just finishing or about to change."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I'd been staring</span> at the screen all night when I suddenly had a great idea.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The Perfect Continuous (both past and present) <span class=\"underline\">focuses on the action</span>, rather than the result."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">What have you been doing?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the examples from the text:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've been reading about it for a while."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It started when I had been having a lot of problems at work."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Then I had been trying for hours to book a flight to go to a conference but all the seats had been sold already."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I had been banking on going to this conference and making a lot of new contacts."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It just seemed like everything I had been trying to schedule fell apart."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">That</span>-Clauses: Reporting Statements"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you report statements, you can use that-clauses in the reported clause."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">She <span class=\"strong\">said that</span> she was enjoying the show.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can omit <span class=\"italic\">that </span>after the most common report verbs, such as: <span class=\"italic\">agree</span>, <span class=\"italic\">mention</span>, <span class=\"italic\">notice</span>, <span class=\"italic\">promise</span>, <span class=\"italic\">say</span> and <span class=\"italic\">think</span>. However, you do not remove it if the clause does not come right after the verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">He <span class=\"strong\">agreed </span>with everyone <span class=\"strong\">that </span>it would be better to wait.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The guy at the shop reported that he couldn't find anything wrong with it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I had promised my boss that I would go."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They claimed that I had booked for 2018! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "This woman who had been standing near me turned to me and told me that I should read up on mercury retrograde."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She said that it was the cause of all my troubles. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to service"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to repair"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I had just gotten my computer serviced so I didn't understand why it crashed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about beliefs and opinions."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to end up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to finally be in a particular place or situation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I ended up taking a train."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to bank on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to depend upon something or someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I had been banking on going to this conference and making a lot of new contacts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "magnet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a \u200bpiece of \u200biron that is \u200bable to \u200battract \u200biron and \u200bsteel \u200bobjects toward itself"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's like a huge magnet passing by the earth."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "core"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "middle"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Mercury has a core of very high-density iron."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on the fritz"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "broken or not working"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's the magnetism that causes electronics and computers to go on the fritz."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fall apart"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to break and be unable to continue in the usual way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It just seemed like everything I had been trying to schedule fell apart. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "high-density"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a high concentration"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to use high-density steel in buildings."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose one of the nine planets that are in our Sun's orbit."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Research your planet on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a poster to show all the facts that you learned about your planet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your poster and information to your class or group."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research a planet on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I create a poster of information about my planet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present my information to a group."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob06re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le17ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm still not really sure about Mercury retrograde. How do you know about it?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I've been reading about it for a while. It started when I had been having a lot of problems at work. My computer crashed and my voicemail wasn't recording any messages. I had just gotten my computer serviced so I didn't understand why it crashed. The guy at the shop reported that he couldn't find anything wrong with it. Then I had been trying for hours to book a flight to go to a conference but all the seats had been sold already. I had been banking on going to this conference and making a lot of new contacts. Also, I had promised my boss that I would go.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So what did you do?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le17ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I ended up taking a train. I got to the conference but somehow my conference ticket was booked under the wrong name. The hotel had my reservations wrong. They claimed that I had booked for 2018!\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds like a huge mix-up!\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, and it just seemed like everything I had been trying to schedule fell apart. I was talking on the phone to a friend, telling him everything that had gone wrong. When I hung up, this woman who had been standing near me turned to me and told me that I should read up on mercury retrograde. She said that it was the cause of all my troubles.", "id": 2, "time": "41000", "image": "engenn10le17ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How does it cause all these problems?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Mercury has a core of very high-density iron. During the retrograde it's passing closer to the Earth, between the Earth and the Sun. It's like a huge magnet passing by the Earth. People believe that it's the magnetism that causes electronics and computers to go on the fritz. This magnetism also affects our own electrical circuits which explains why people get forgetful, say things they don't mean, or do things they normally wouldn't do.", "id": 3, "time": "75000", "image": "engenn10le17ob06re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss coincidences and strange events."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can say what has been happening and what had been happening."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can report statements about opinions and beliefs."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you think that the movement of planets can affect how people think or behave? Why or why not?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Why do you think that some people believe that the planets can affect our minds?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " Mercury is like a giant magnet!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [2], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nPeter talks about his <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">first-hand experiences</span> with Mercury retrograde.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "May